81
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:55,000
Although automatic binding of the bone grid will automatically divide the weight,

82
00:06:55,000 --> 00:07:01,000
it is also very important to perform weight selection operations when adjusting joints or poses,

83
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:05,000
