90
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:26,000
You can use the shortcut keys to control and tab to switch.

91
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:30,000
Increase will increase the weight, decrease will decrease the weight,

92
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:35,000
