93
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:40,000
In the properties of the brush, you can adjust the strength, size, hardness and depth.

94
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:43,000
The strength can be set to the strength of the brush.

95
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:52,000
You can use the slider or the shortcut keys to adjust the size.

96
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:54,000
The size can be set to the size of the brush.

97
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:57,000
The shortcut keys are the left and right middle brackets.

98
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:01,000
The hardness can be adjusted to the strength difference between the center of the brush and the edge.

99
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:05,000
Finally, the depth represents the depth of the brush.

100
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:10,000
You can reset the properties of the brush by pressing the reset button.

101
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:16,000
Pressing the reset button can release the brush tool and return to the EveryMill window.

102
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:24,000
