109
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:48,000
The weight value is zero in the area where the color is not displayed.

110
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:53,000
The more weight assigned to a specific area, the greater the influence in the animation process.

111
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:57,000
This helps to control the movement more smoothly and naturally.

112
00:08:57,000 --> 00:09:03,000
